# LEDGERAI PH — FULL ENTERPRISE FUNCTIONAL READINESS, ACCOUNTING ACCURACY & END-TO-END WORKFLOW AUDIT

## MISSION

Conduct a comprehensive, evidence-based audit of the entire LedgerAI PH application to determine whether every visible control, button, action, transaction workflow, approval process, accounting computation, BIR tax treatment, financial report, data source, and Ledger Agent AI capability is genuinely functional and reliable for real enterprise accounting operations in the Philippines.

This is a FULL SYSTEM AUDIT, not a UI review.

The objective is to establish the exact current implementation status, identify every incomplete or defective requirement, and produce one controlled, prioritized remediation backlog that will guide all subsequent development until the application is ready for real business use.

The audit must cover the entire application from the first screen and first module through the final administration and governance modules.

