Its backup and recovery process must be verified. Include the knowledge package and its version/checksum in the appropriate backup manifest or system backup process, without contaminating company financial tables or mixing one company's private records into another company's knowledge.

Verify that restored systems can recover the correct knowledge version and that updated procedures are not silently lost.

Test AI responses against real application workflows and known accounting/tax cases, not only general conversation prompts.

